# Google Sheets API Configuration
# IMPORTANT: You need a valid Google Sheets API key here!
# 
# The value below is NOT a valid API key - it's the private_key_id from the service account.
# 
# To get a proper API key:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Select your project: bridal-custom-calculator
# 3. Click "Create Credentials" → "API Key"
# 4. Copy the generated key (starts with "AIza...")
# 5. Paste it below
#
# OR make your Google Sheet publicly accessible:
# 1. Open your Google Sheet
# 2. Click "Share" → "Anyone with the link" → "Viewer"
# 3. Then you can leave this empty or use: NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SHEETS_API_KEY=

NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SHEETS_API_KEY=AIzaSyAkRT6vkVwBBxJPG7GpGOVafV4p7bWJ3Iw
